MtSilver_Cave1_Text_Fossil_3::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "Then this fossil is mine!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_Scientist_1::
	.string "Far away, on CINNABAR ISLAND,\n"
	.string "there’s a POKéMON LAB.\p"
	.string "They do research on regenerating\n"
	.string "fossils.$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_Scientist_2::
	.string "We’ll each take a fossil!\n"
	.string "No being greedy!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_Scientist_3::
	.string "Hey, stop!\p"
	.string "I found these fossils!\n"
	.string "They’re both mine!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_ScientistDefeat::
	.string "Okay!\n"
	.string "I’ll share!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt7Intro::
	.string "Little kids shouldn’t be messing\n"
	.string "around with grown-ups!\p"
	.string "It could be bad news!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt7Defeat::
	.string "I’m steamed!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt7::
	.string "POKéMON lived here long before\n"
	.string "people came.$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt4Intro::
	.string "We, TEAM ROCKET, shall find the\n"
	.string "fossils!\p"
	.string "Reviving POKéMON from them will\n"
	.string "earn us huge riches!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt4Defeat::
	.string "Urgh!\n"
	.string "Now I’m mad!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt4::
	.string "You made me mad!\n"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET will blacklist you!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt6Intro::
	.string "We’re pulling a big job here!\n"
	.string "Get lost, kid!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt6Defeat::
	.string "So, you are good…$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt6::
	.string "If you find a fossil, give it to me\n"
	.string "and scram!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt5Intro::
	.string "We, TEAM ROCKET, are POKéMON\n"
	.string "gangsters!\l"
	.string "We strike fear with our strength!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt5Defeat::
	.string "I blew it!$"

MtSilver_Cave1_Text_TeamRocketGrunt5::
	.string "Darn it all!\n"
	.string "My associates won’t stand for this!$"
